@startuml
title eBPF 事件传输与消费
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "BPF probes" as Probes
queue "ring buffer\n或 perf buffer" as KernelBuffer
component "单一消费线程" as Consumer
queue "有界 batch queue\n32 batches" as Queue
component "daemon 主循环" as Daemon
component "trace 诊断" as Diag

Probes --> KernelBuffer : 内核事件
KernelBuffer --> Consumer : ppoll + greedy consume
Consumer --> Queue : 最多 4096 条 / 2 MiB
Queue --> Daemon : eventfd 唤醒
Daemon --> Daemon : 解码、因果排序、投影、持久化
KernelBuffer --> Diag : perf lost
Probes --> Diag : reserve/output failure
Diag --> Daemon : event_transport_loss\n标记当前 trace 降级
@enduml
